Grok solved the final `n=84` escalation, so the harness verdict is now necessarily `too_easy`; one last sampled call remains before it writes the final metadata. I’ll preserve that transcript as evidence while removing the non-shippable module and documenting this failed Track B attempt in `REJECTED.md`.
